    {
      "end": -330,
      "description": "Hansen (2004) notes that Karystos was forced to join the Delian League following a defeat at the hands of Athens ca. 469 B.C. The Karystians are recorded as paying tribute from 454/3 to 416/15 B.C. Karystos remained in the league even when other Euboean polities defected in 446 B.C.",
